#: cogs/music/music.py:3332
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Secondary music controls (the everyday ones - play, queue, skip, pause, resume, stop, volume, nowplaying - stay on their own):\n"
"- `{p}music search <query>` - browse tracks and albums\n"
"- `{p}music seek <position>` - jump within the track\n"
"- `{p}music previous` - replay the previous track\n"
"- `{p}music shuffle` - shuffle the queue\n"
"- `{p}music loop <mode>` - loop track, all, or off\n"
"- `{p}music clearqueue` - empty the upcoming queue\n"
"- `{p}music played` - what this session has played\n"
"- `{p}music lyrics` - lyrics for the current track\n"
"- `{p}music filter <preset>` - apply an audio effect\n"
"- `{p}music disconnect` - leave the voice channel"
msgstr ""
"Commandes musicales secondaires (les quotidiennes - play, queue, skip, pause, resume, stop, volume, nowplaying - restent independantes) :\n"
"- `{p}music search <recherche>` - parcourir titres et albums\n"
"- `{p}music seek <position>` - se deplacer dans la piste\n"
"- `{p}music previous` - rejouer la piste precedente\n"
"- `{p}music shuffle` - melanger la file\n"
"- `{p}music loop <mode>` - boucler la piste, tout, ou rien\n"
"- `{p}music clearqueue` - vider la file a venir\n"
"- `{p}music played` - ce que cette session a joue\n"
"- `{p}music lyrics` - les paroles de la piste en cours\n"
"- `{p}music filter <preset>` - appliquer un effet audio\n"
"- `{p}music disconnect` - quitter le salon vocal"

